{"id":"2570c1d198fdad1d","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/858_乘法线性逻辑_MLL.md","title":"858 乘法线性逻辑 MLL","display":"858_乘法线性逻辑_MLL","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Lit}=\\{p^+:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\cup\\{p^-:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^+)=p^-\">\\(\\partial(p^+)=p^-\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p^-)=p^+\">\\(\\partial(p^-)=p^+\\)</span>。MLL 的原始公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与对偶\">2. 公式与对偶</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lit}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{lit}(\\partial(a)),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{tensor}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{tensor}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价\">3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^+)=p\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p^-)=p\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{lit}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{one})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{bot})\n=\n\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{one})\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{bot})\n=\n\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给出。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^+)=\\sigma(p)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p^-)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lit}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)=p_m,\\qquad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:p_i\\notin X\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\)</span>。对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{lit}(\\rho(p)^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-上下文与相继式\">4. 上下文与相继式</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\Gamma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\to\\mathbb N:\n\\{A:\\Gamma(A)&gt;0\\}\\text{ 有限}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上下文相等为函数外延相等。空上下文是恒 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 函数，并定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta)(A)=\\Gamma(A)+\\Delta(A),\\qquad\n\\mathbf1_A(B)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;B=A,\\\\0&amp;B\\ne A,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf1_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta)(A)=\\Gamma(A)+\\Delta(A),\\qquad\n\\mathbf1_A(B)=\\begin{cases}1&amp;B=A,\\\\0&amp;B\\ne A,\\end{cases}\n\\qquad\\Gamma,A=\\Gamma\\uplus\\mathbf1_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相继式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\{\\vdash\\Gamma:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^n\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^n\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为有限前提列集合。每个规则族均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。对当地相继式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i,Q\">\\(Q_i,Q\\)</span>，约定</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{m-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{m-1}),Q),\\qquad (();Q):=((),Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{m-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{m-1}),Q),\\qquad (();Q):=((),Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义初始相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\operatorname{one}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash A,A^\\perp:A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{\\vdash\\operatorname{one}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则关系由下列集合并成：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}=\\{(();\\vdash A,A^\\perp):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp);\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,A^\\perp);\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B);\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta,\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A),(\\vdash\\Delta,B);\\vdash\\Gamma\\uplus\\Delta,\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma,A,B);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}=\\{(();\\vdash\\operatorname{one})\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}=\\{(();\\vdash\\operatorname{one})\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\n=\n\\{((\\vdash\\Gamma);\\vdash\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}):\n\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{ax}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{1}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}\">\\(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 为以下条件的合取：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;|T|&lt;\\omega,\\quad r\\in T,\\quad\\prec\\subseteq T^2,\\quad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;|T|&lt;\\omega,\\quad r\\in T,\\quad\\prec\\subseteq T^2,\\quad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\prec u\">\\(v\\prec u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点。根、父节点、可达性和无环条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(r\\prec u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in T\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!u\\in T\\;(v\\prec u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(r\\prec u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in T\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!u\\in T\\;(v\\prec u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\in T\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=v\\land a(k)=r\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall v\\in T\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=v\\land a(k)=r\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=a(k)\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=a(k)\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子列恰好无重复地枚举全部直接子节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{ch}(u):n\\to T\\text{ 为单射}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{ch}(u):n\\to T\\text{ 为单射}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,Q\">\\(\\pi,Q\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})\n\\lor(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})\n\\lor(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 是有序子标号列，空子列对应零前提规则。公理叶和规则节点是许可的两个备选分支，没有开放假设叶。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 定义证明纤维类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash\\Gamma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\Gamma)\n=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash\\Gamma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里及以下证明纤维按参数展开为可定义类，成员断言缩写右侧谓词；任意节点重标号的全体不被声明为集合，也不供幂集消费。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可导关系\">7. 可导关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash\\Gamma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash\\Gamma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\Gamma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 定义证明类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法结构载体：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\)</span>，定义句法满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nQ\\in X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义闭包谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\subseteq X\n\\ \\wedge\\\n\\forall \\Pi\\in(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}})^{&lt;\\omega}\\ \\forall Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl((\\Pi,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\\wedge\\operatorname{ran}(\\Pi)\\subseteq X\\Rightarrow Q\\in X\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义句法后承：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall X\\in\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}}Q\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>MLL 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{par}\\},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该对象记录 MLL 只含乘法单位、乘法连接词和文字对偶；不含加法、指数、弱化或收缩规则。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>以下是元层规格包；证明类按第 6–7 节谓词模式展开，不是将真类作为集合元素的元组。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{At},\n\\mathsf{Lit},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n(-)^\\perp,\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{BN}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{freshAt}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Str}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\models_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\operatorname{Closed}_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\Vdash_{\\mathsf{MLL}},\n\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{MLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含乘法线性逻辑句法、多重集相继式、规则关系、证明树、句法满足、闭包后承和可导关系；不含加法、指数或外延语义模型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与对偶","text":"2. 公式与对偶","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由原子、替换与-α-等价","text":"3. 自由原子、替换与 α 等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-上下文与相继式","text":"4. 上下文与相继式","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导关系","text":"7. 可导关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","disp